LymeOldLyme -> Middletown[label="3.2
04/29", weight="97", tooltip="NEIRA Boys & Girls Fours,LOLHS v Middletown			
Distance: 1500 Conditions: 3-6MPH building head wind progressing down the course Comments: Boys 4th boat was a Bn4. Girls 4th boat was a Gn4. 
The boys 4th(Bn4) race stopped after the first start due to a collision between Lyme/Old Lyme and Middletown. The race was then restarted at the 1000m mark. The race was restarted with Middletown steering to the outside lane. 
It was a good day to race out on rogers lake. Other than the novice boys 4 (4th boat) all races had no issues lining up and racing. We look forward to seeing Middletown again!
